tyle=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedicationPrescription-definitions.html#EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.validityPeriod\" title=\"The period over which the prescription is considered valid and dispensable. validityPeriod.start is, if missing, assumed to be the date of issuance of the prescription.\">validityPeriod</a><a name=\"EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.validityPeriod\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#Period\">Period</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">The period over which the prescription is considered valid and dispensable. validityPeriod.start is, if missing, assumed to be the date of issuance of the prescription.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck011.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedicationPrescription-definitions.html#EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.substitution\" title=\"Whether and, if so, which type of substitution is allowed, as indicated by the prescriber, for this prescription. The legislation in the country of dispensation applies for performing a substitution.\">substitution</a><a name=\"EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.substitution\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Base</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Whether and, if so, which type of substitution is allowed, as indicated by the prescriber, for this prescription. The legislation in the country of dispensation applies for performing a substitution.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck0111.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_choice.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Choice of Types\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.substitution.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedicationPrescription-definitions.html#EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.substitution.allowed[x]\" title=\"Whether and, if so, to what extent substitution is allowed.\">allowed[x]</a><a name=\"EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.substitution.allowed_x_\"> </a></td><td style=\"\