_end.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.substitution.reason[x].</span><span title=\"string Type: A sequence of Unicode characters\">reasonString</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#string\">string</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedicationPrescription-definitions.html#EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.numberOfRepeats\" title=\"Number of refills authorised – how many times the prescription item may be dispensed in addition to the original dispensation. If the element is missing, no repeats are authorised.\">numberOfRepeats</a><a name=\"EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.numberOfRepeats\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#integer\">integer</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Number of refills authorised – how many times the prescription item may be dispensed in addition to the original dispensation. If the element is missing, no repeats are authorised.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck010.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedicationPrescription-definitions.html#EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.minimumDispenseInterval\" title=\"Minimum dispensation interval. If a prescription allows for repeated dispensations, the interval between dispensations shall be stated here.\">minimumDispenseInterval</a><a name=\"EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.minimumDispenseInterval\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#Quantity\">Quantity</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Minimum dispensation interval. If a prescription allows for repeated dispensations, the interval between dispensations shall be stated here.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck011.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedicationPrescription-definitions.html#EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.offLabel\" title=\"Indicates that the medicinal product is knowingly prescribed for use for an age group, dosage or route of administration not included in the authorised product information.\">offLabel</a><a name=\"EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.offLabel\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Base</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Indicates that the medicinal product is knowingly prescribed for use for an age group, dosage or route of administration not included in the authorised product information.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck0110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_blank.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_primitive.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Primitive Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.offLabel.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSMedicationPrescription-definitions.html#EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.offLabel.isOffLabelUse\" title=\"Indicates whether the medicinal product is prescribed outside the terms of its marketing authorisation. The value shall be ‘true’ if the medicinal product is prescribed for off-label use and ‘false’ otherwise. Where a reason for off-label use is provided, the value shall be ‘true’.\">isOffLabelUse</a><a name=\"EHDSMedicationPrescription.prescriptionItem.offLabel.isOffLabelUse\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/datatypes.html#boolean\">boolean</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Indicates whether the medicinal product is prescribed outside the terms of its marketing authorisation. The value shall be ‘true’ if the medicinal product is prescribed for off-label use and ‘false’ otherwise. Where a reason for off-label use is provided, the value shall be ‘true’.</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck0101.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spa